WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:05.084
A quick tour of the Desk

2
00:00:05.595 --> 00:00:10.846
Everything starts on the Books page: your books, today's words and your writing streak.

3
00:00:10.847 --> 00:00:17.077
The bar along the top takes you to each part of the Desk.

4
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.945
Pen names holds the names you publish under.

5
00:00:21.947 --> 00:00:26.428
Progress shows your streak and daily words.

6
00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:32.586
Website sets up your own author site.

7
00:00:32.588 --> 00:00:40.742
Your account menu has light and dark mode, the AI assistant, help and these guides.

8
00:00:40.745 --> 00:00:49.227
Dark mode is easier on the eyes at night. Choose Match my device to follow your computer.

9
00:00:49.229 --> 00:00:52.204
Stuck? Help and Learn are always in this menu.
